{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your mop and bucket and get ready to <strong>explore</strong> in the wild world of <i>War of the Wormholes</i>!<i> </i>Take the role of a janitor cleaning an Astronaut in the Box (a galactic arm spanning fast food chain).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565940/extras/Burger.gif?t=1744860246\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get recruited onto the <strong>Inconceivable</strong>, a formidable and feared privateer vessel of a desperate alliance of humans and aliens trying to fend off the darkest threats to the galaxy. Explore the ship and meet fantastical aliens and robots, find <strong>hidden rooms </strong>and<strong> secrets</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565940/extras/Space.gif?t=1744860246\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a retro <i>point and click </i>adventure game set in a unique and immersive world filled with aliens, robots, adventure, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets galore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving and loading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging Puzzles! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No deaths and no dead ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique world brought to life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music by Kevin Macleod and The Minute Hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive galactic guide. (In the main menu)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Restaurant Renaissance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamc